# Architecture

## Overview

{{ project_name }} is a Python library using a src layout.

## Project Structure

```
src/{{ package_name }}/     # Library source code
  __init__.py               # Package init, exposes __version__
  py.typed                  # PEP 561 type stub marker
tests/
  unit/                     # Fast, isolated unit tests
  integration/              # Tests with real dependencies
  e2e/                      # End-to-end tests
```

## Toolchain

| Tool | Purpose |
| ---- | ------- |
| uv | Package management, virtual environments |
| hatchling | Build backend |
| ruff | Formatting and linting |
| ty | Type checking |
| pytest | Testing |

## Conventions

- All configuration is in `pyproject.toml`.
- Version is the single source of truth in `pyproject.toml`, read via `importlib.metadata`.
- `py.typed` marker enables downstream type checking (PEP 561).
